
NTeX Release 1.2 --- ntb-dlj 1.2 --- status: recommended

This are the binaries for the dvi2xx drivers based on the kpathsea
library. It contains the drivers dvi2lj, dvi2lj2p, dvi2lj4 and 
dvilj4l for the HP Laserjet series and compatible laser printers.
The current version is 2.1 using the kpathsea library 2.1.

